    "description": "## Objective\n\nCreate the tab-based Lightning Console app used for the demo and eventually by reps.\n\n## Implementation Requirements\n\n* Lightning Console app named WagerTech with navigation items: Sign-Ups, Study Link Clicks, Deals, Deal-Rep Assignments, Players\n* List views: My Open Sign-Ups; Overdue Sign-Ups; Clicks — Review Required; Active Deals by Partner\n* Compact layouts and highlights panels for Sign-Up, Study Link Click, Deal, Player\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n* The full demo storyline is navigable inside the Console app\n\n## Testing Notes\n\nDry-run the demo script in the Console.\n\n## Out of Scope\n\nCustom Lightning components, full Dynamic Forms pass.\n\n---\n\nEstimate: M · \\~6h · Dependencies: POC-06 to POC-10 · Ticket POC-14 (approved 2026-07-04)",
